ble bond. Through its function in carotenoids metabolism regulates oxidative stress and the production of important signaling molecules."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}